  },
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In a one dimensional collision between two identical particles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is stationary and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> has momentum <math><mi>p</mi></math> before impact. During impact <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> gives an impulse <math><mi>J</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>. Then the coefficient of restitution between the two is</p>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>J</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>J</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> be the momenta of <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> after collision.<br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0029_78c3c62395f7.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 414px; height: 77px;\" /><br /><br />Then applying impulse = change in linear momentum for the two particles<br /><br />For <math><mi>B</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />For <math><mi>A</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />Or <math><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>J</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />Coefficient of restitution <math><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>J</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>"
  }
}